{
  "id": 8834770993351,
  "title": "Custom Football Above Yard Lines Perspective Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-football-above-yard-lines-perspective-comforter-2c2cb25ed8-2c2cb25ed8",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space with the Jeminise sports bedding set, offering a cozy and stylish design perfect for football fans, players, and coaches. Whether you choose the lightweight duvet cover or the cozy all-in-one comforter, this bedding brings the spirit of the game into your bedroom, kids' room, or guestroom. It makes a thoughtful, personalized gift for holidays, birthdays, and special celebrations.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Fully customizable with 2 text inputs for a name and number to make your sports bedding unique.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, lightweight, and highly durable feel for all-season comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Duvet Cover &amp; Comforter Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight duvet cover designed for an insert, or a thicker comforter filled with clean microfiber to prevent clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly sized for various beds, including Twin (68x88 in), Full (78x88 in), Queen (88x88 in), and King (104x88 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes 1 duvet cover or comforter, with options to add matching pillowcases or a flat sheet.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry on low heat or air dry without heat.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Golden Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
